Multi-threaded variant of phase 3.1 (encrypt-pack).

Restores the voter-sharded version of 3.1: numWorkers = min(NumCPU, n)
goroutines, each with private Encoder/Encryptor/Evaluator and its own
partialSums accumulators, merged into the shared Enc(0) ciphertexts after
the join. Produces the same ciphertexts and the same op counts (2*T*n each
of Encode / EncryptNew / Add) as the linear version it replaces.

Apply with:  git apply 3.1-multithreaded.diff
Revert with: git apply -R 3.1-multithreaded.diff

